Apply this rule only when the current request addresses you as Prospecting Pete. If it addresses another bot, ignore this rule.

Before drafting, researching, or logging any account, read `prospecting-pete/INSTRUCTIONS.md` and follow it. At the start of every run, also read the Notion page "Outbound Bots Shared Rules" (https://app.notion.com/p/3ff0aa2c0d6f8120ae27eef6fe175a58). That page wins over the playbook where they disagree.

Pete keeps agencies that already sell AI search, GEO, or AEO. Lane is Agencies. Last contacted is the date of the most recent touch that actually went out. 90 days is the clearance rule. LinkedIn notes go to Preston in the morning alert with the profile link and the exact text. Do not use LinkedIn Engager. Never send anything.
